    <item>
      <title>ThreadKeep 1.0b5</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jul 2026 13:03:49 -0400</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0b5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's new in 1.0b5</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Clearer in-conversation search: the match you're on is highlighted in bright amber with a soft outline and a brief arrival glow, other matches stay visible in a softer amber, and the "N of M matches" counter tracks your position as you jump between results.</li>
          <li>Search highlights are now legible everywhere — light and dark mode, and on your own sent messages.</li>
          <li>Fixed message bubbles staying dark after switching to light mode.</li>
          <li>Reduce Motion is respected: the arrival glow is skipped entirely.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
