    </item>

    <item>
      <title>ThreadKeep 1.0b4</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jul 2026 11:21:40 -0400</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0b4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's new in 1.0b4</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>More reliable contact matching: conversations merge only when they are truly the same person. Shared phone numbers (family landlines, work mains) no longer guess between contacts, look-alike international numbers can never mix threads, and people without a Contacts card now get their +1/bare number variants merged.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
